OL,3,GNEWSAFire service celebrates
OL,4,A'fantastic' station reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been invited to
OL,7,Fcelebrate the reopening of a town's
OL,8,Ffire station.
OL,10,FReigate fire station on Croydon Road
OL,11,Fhas been redeveloped with a new
OL,12,Fkitchen, gym and lounge for its crews,
OL,13,Falongside bays for its fire engines.
OL,15,FA free community event, where locals
OL,16,Fcan see the station and its fleet, is
OL,17,Fplanned between 14:00 and 18:00 GMT on
OL,18,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
