OL,3,GNEWSAFire service celebrates
OL,4,A'fantastic' station reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Quin, chief fire officer at Surrey
OL,7,FFire and Rescue Service (SFRS), said:
OL,8,F"The open afternoon is a great
OL,9,Fopportunity to mark such a momentous
OL,10,Foccasion for the service and,
OL,11,Fimportantly, have fun with our
OL,12,Fcommunity."
